WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.572
- What's your new show Briarpatch about?

00:00:02.572 --> 00:00:06.880
- Well my character is a suddenly given

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.330
the news that her sister has died.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.750
She was a police officer
and died in a car bomb.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.550
So she goes back to her
hometown to investigate

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.640
her sister's murder and
it just gets crazier

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.060
and more wild and weirder than that.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.390
She also works for in
a Senate subcommittee.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.900
She works for a Senator
who she's you know,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.455
in having a situation with.

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:29.288
A relationship with.

00:00:29.288 --> 00:00:30.121
- [Kelly] Maybe relations?

00:00:30.121 --> 00:00:30.960
- Maybe relations with.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.500
- Is that why you're dating Cory Booker?

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.033
You are as research?

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:34.894
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:34.894 --> 00:00:35.727
- No.

00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:36.560
- [Kelly] It was research.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.393
- No, actually.

00:00:37.393 --> 00:00:39.510
- You are very method,
that's all I'm saying.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.040
No I just, I had to point out,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.920
I think he's so awesome.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.510
I think this is the reason
why I wanted to put it out

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.780
because I think he's so awesome

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.140
and I think it's very
telling of your character

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.990
to to want a man like
that that's so strong

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.420
and so independent, knows what he wants

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.670
and knows what's good for people?

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.503
He's a cool dude.

00:00:53.503 --> 00:00:55.030
- He is a really great, very cool dude.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.490
- But it's also research too.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.624
I'm just kidding.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:58.820
- It's so funny 'cause we did,

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.730
we shot the pilot for the
show in September of 2018

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:06.240
and then Cory and I started
dating in October of 2018.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.700
And I remember when the show got picked

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.520
up and we started doing
ADR and we were gonna

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.390
film the rest of it last year,

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.490
I talked to the show
writer Andy and I was like,

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:18.070
so art imitates art or life imitates art.

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:19.390
I think I have the answer to that finally.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.460
- I know it's so crazy, yeah,

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.860
it just sounds like a cool show.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:24.620
- Yeah, luckily when
you watch the show it's

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:26.890
definitely more cynical
version of looking at politics

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:31.320
and looking at sort of the
world in general, or not.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.300
But yeah, that's not the case
with Cory, thank goodness.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.400
- [Kelly] I know, no he seems really cool.

